    "<b>Scav:</b> Time to kick some ass!\n<b>Scav:</b> Let’s roll!": "<b>스캐브:</b> 한판 붙어 보자고!\n<b>스캐브:</b> 가자!",
    "<b>MP Officer:</b> They're pushing through the center!": "<b>헌병:</b> 중앙으로 밀고 들어온다!",
